        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"683db855-6f3e-411c-9ee4-a626c3009a50\",\"review_text\":\"T 6ef\"},{\"review_id\":\"eeef49cf-10f0-4e6b-b34c-4b9c24647070\",\"review_text\":\"The app just stops all the time!! I have had a premium account on my android phone for years, and had to upgrade phones and now the app will not work properly. If I cannot find a solution very soon, I will have to end a family account.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e4a46ede-48ca-43c6-bf21-9143cb887d02\",\"review_text\":\"New update is literally annoying\"},{\"review_id\":\"23dba90f-17d7-4ee7-9b6f-1603a2f81335\",\"review_text\":\"Fix it I can't play the song that I like it\"},{\"review_id\":\"554e688c-1ece-4dea-b788-6bfeb602a7fa\",\"review_text\":\"Great for podcasts and playlists\"},{\"review_id\":\"55a7f0d1-9f44-4470-b3a9-ad18f53bee08\",\"review_text\":\"£9.99 is a bit on the pricey side especially for people who just want to play their favourite song on loop without ads.Aldo dont appreciate it when random songs ive never heard of start playing during my playlist .Cant even skip them as you will end up using the 6 skips and then have to wait a whole hour before u can skip again. Music selection is decent and audio is great but its these limits and experience which make the app less enjoyable when you want to relax after a long day of work/school\"},{\"review_id\":\"f062e73e-aa78-43dc-a5e4-d268ce3b6abb\",\"review_text\":\"STOP MANIPULATING STREAM COUNTS JUST SO YOUR PEOPLE WILL BE ON TOP. HAVE SOME SHAME\"},{\"review_id\":\"d0b37707-5979-452b-951e-782324f41055\",\"review_text\":\"Yesth\"},{\"review_id\":\"a656555f-1d14-4fad-9099-4e98345f5445\",\"review_text\":\"Good sound\"},{\"review_id\":\"75ece737-ff41-4901-80b6-32bd09269ea1\",\"review_text\":\"I have premium but then too i can't share lyrics on snapchat. Please bring this feature back.\"}]}"
